{"unit_id":"tag:09XP:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme），设<MATH_0002>为闭子概形（closed subscheme）。设<MATH_0003>为<MATH_0004>上的阿贝尔层（abelian sheaf）。令\n<MATH_0005>\n为截面（sections），其支集（support）在<MATH_0006>中（定义<REF_0001>）。这是左正合（left exact）函子（functor），一般并不正合（exact）。因此得到导出函子（derived functor）\n<MATH_0007>\n，以及支集（support）在<MATH_0008>中的上同调群（cohomology groups），定义为<MATH_0009>。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n设<MATH_0010>为内射（injective）阿贝尔层（abelian sheaf），它在<MATH_0011>上。设<MATH_0012>。则限制（restriction）映射（map）<MATH_0013>满射（surjective）（景上的上同调（Cohomology on Sites）引理<REF_0002>），其核（kernel）为<MATH_0014>。立即得到，对<MATH_0015>有标准三角（distinguished triangle）\n<MATH_0016>\n，位于<MATH_0017>中。因此得到长正合（long exact）上同调（cohomology）序列（sequence）\n<MATH_0018>\n，对任意<MATH_0019>成立，其中它位于<MATH_0020>中。\n\n<STRUCT_0004><STRUCT_0005>\n对于阿贝尔层（abelian sheaf）<MATH_0021>，它在<MATH_0022>上，可以考虑<TEXTITOPEN_0001>支集位于<MATH_0023>中的截面子层（subsheaf of sections with support）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，记为<MATH_0024>，由规则\n<MATH_0025>\n定义。这里使用定义<REF_0003>中截面（section）的支集（support）。使用命题<REF_0004>的等价（equivalence），可将<MATH_0026>视为<MATH_0027>上的阿贝尔层（abelian sheaf）。于是得到函子（functor）\n<MATH_0028>\n，它左正合（left exact），但一般并不正合（exact）。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"closed subscheme","target_term":"闭子概形"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"sections","target_term":"截面"},{"source_term":"support","target_term":"支集"},{"source_term":"left exact","target_term":"左正合"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"},{"source_term":"derived functor","target_term":"导出函子"},{"source_term":"support","target_term":"支集"},{"source_term":"cohomology groups","target_term":"上同调群"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"内射"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"restriction","target_term":"限制"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"Cohomology on Sites","target_term":"景上的上同调"},{"source_term":"kernel","target_term":"核"},{"source_term":"distinguished triangle","target_term":"标准三角"},{"source_term":"long exact","target_term":"长正合"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"},{"source_term":"sequence","target_term":"序列"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"subsheaf of sections with support","target_term":"支集位于<MATH_0023>中的截面子层"},{"source_term":"section","target_term":"截面"},{"source_term":"support","target_term":"支集"},{"source_term":"equivalence","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"left exact","target_term":"左正合"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"closed subscheme","target_term":"闭子概形","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"sections","target_term":"截面","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"support","target_term":"支集","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"left exact","target_term":"左正合","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"derived functor","target_term":"导出函子","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"cohomology groups","target_term":"上同调群","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"内射","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"restriction","target_term":"限制","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"Cohomology on Sites","target_term":"景上的上同调","context":"引用章节暂译。"},{"source_term":"kernel","target_term":"核","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"distinguished triangle","target_term":"标准三角","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"long exact","target_term":"长正合","context":"待决。"},{"source_ter