{"unit_id":"tag:0AEG:proof","translation":"回忆<MATH_0001>与<MATH_0002>构成伴随（adjoint）的一对正合（exact）函子（functors），使得<MATH_0003>同构（isomorphic）于阿贝尔层（abelian sheaves）上的恒等（identify）函子（functor）。见命题<REF_0001>和引理<REF_0002>。因此<MATH_0004>完全忠实（fully faithful），而<MATH_0005>确定一个左逆（inverse）。另一方面，设<MATH_0006>为<MATH_0007>的对象（object），考虑伴随（adjunction）映射（map）<MATH_0008>。利用<MATH_0009>与<MATH_0010>的正合性（exactness），这在上同调层（cohomology sheaves）上诱导伴随（adjunction）映射（maps）<MATH_0011>。由于这些上同调层（cohomology sheaves）的支集（supported）位于<MATH_0012>上，这些伴随（adjunction）映射（maps）是同构（isomorphisms），故<MATH_0013>为等价（equivalence）。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n为完成证明，须证明<MATH_0014>，当<MATH_0015>为<MATH_0016>的对象（object）时。为此，可利用<MATH_0017>，因为刚才已经证明这一点。于是可选择 K-内射（injective）代表（representative）<MATH_0018>来代表<MATH_0019>。由于<MATH_0020>为右伴随（right adjoint），其对应的正合（exact）函子（functor）为<MATH_0021>，复形（complex）<MATH_0022>是 K-内射（injective）的（导出范畴（Derived Categories）引理<REF_0003>）。可见<MATH_0023>由<MATH_0024>计算，正如所需。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"adjoint","target_term":"伴随"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaves","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"identify","target_term":"恒等"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"fully faithful","target_term":"完全忠实"},{"source_term":"inverse","target_term":"左逆"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"adjunction","target_term":"伴随"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"exactness","target_term":"正合性"},{"source_term":"cohomology sheaves","target_term":"上同调层"},{"source_term":"adjunction","target_term":"伴随"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"cohomology sheaves","target_term":"上同调层"},{"source_term":"supported","target_term":"支集"},{"source_term":"adjunction","target_term":"伴随"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"isomorphisms","target_term":"同构"},{"source_