{"unit_id":"tag:0A46:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>为闭子概形（closed subscheme）。设<MATH_0003>为拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）的<MATH_0004>-模（module），用<MATH_0005>表示关联拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf），它位于小（small）平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）景（site）上，该景属于<MATH_0006>（命题<REF_0001>）。则\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0007>与<MATH_0008>一致，\n<STRUCT_0003> 若<MATH_0009>的补集（complement）在<MATH_0010>中是相对拟紧（retrocompact）的，则<MATH_0011>是拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf），其为<MATH_0012>-模（modules），等于<MATH_0013>。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"closed subscheme","target_term":"闭子概形"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent","target_term":"拟凝聚"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent sheaf","target_term":"拟凝聚层"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"complement","target_term":"补集"},{"source_term":"retrocompact","target_term":"相对拟紧"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent sheaf","target_term":"拟凝聚层"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"closed subscheme","target_term":"闭子概形","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent","target_term":"拟凝聚","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent sheaf","target_term":"拟凝聚层","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"complement","target_term":"补集","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"retrocompact","target_term":"相对拟紧","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0A46:proof","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为<MATH_0002>的补集的包含（inclusion）。关于上同调群（cohomology groups）的陈述 (1) 由长正合序列（exact sequences），即带支集（supports）的上同调（cohomology）序列，以及<MATH_0003>和<MATH_0004>的一致性得到，见定理<REF_0001>。若<MATH_0005>为拟紧（quasi-compact）态射（morphism），即<MATH_0006>为相对拟紧（retrocompact）的，则<MATH_0007>把拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaves）变成拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaves）（概形的上同调（Cohomology of Schemes）引理<REF_0002>），并交换（commutes）于取关联层（sheaf）的操作，此操作在平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）景（sites）上进行（下降（Descent）引理<REF_0003>）。应用引理<REF_0004>即得结论。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"inclusion","target_term":"包含"},{"source_term":"cohomology groups","target_term":"上同调群"},{"source_term":"exact sequences","target_term":"长正合序列"},{"source_term":"supports","target_term":"支集"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"retrocompact","target_term":"相对拟紧"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent sheaves","target_term":"拟凝聚层"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent sheaves","target_term":"拟凝聚层"},{"source_term":"Cohomology of Schemes","target_term":"概形的上同调"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"关联层"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"inclusion","target_term":"包含","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"cohomology groups","target_term":"上同调群","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"exact sequences","target_term":"长正合序列","context":"原文 long exact sequences，限定 long 已保留，待决。"},{"source_term":"supports","target_term":"支集","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"retrocompact","target_term":"相对拟紧","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"quasi-co